    "No evidence on whether the query is a substrate for uptake transporters that could partially offset efflux.",
    "No human CNS exposure data for the exact query structure.",
    "No dose-response or steady-state brain pharmacokinetic data for the query."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

